---
/**
 * Starlight's ThemeProvider, replaced with nothing.
 *
 * The stock component injects an inline script that reads a stored preference
 * and stamps `data-theme` on <html> before paint. These docs are light-only —
 * Ward's UI is a light limestone surface and the docs share its ground — so
 * there is no preference to restore and no flash to prevent. Rendering nothing
 * is the whole override.
 *
 * Paired with ThemeSelect.astro, which removes the toggle that would otherwise
 * offer a choice this site does not honour.
 */
